    "id": "INDEX_UNUSABLE_FOR_QUERY_PATTERN",
    "severity": "HIGH",
    "layer": "class→service",
    "title": "DDL 声明的 idx_products_name 对服务层查询模式无效（7.959ms vs 0.015ms，差 531 倍）",
    "detail": "迁移文件建了 products(name) 索引，但服务层关键词搜索写的是 lower(name) LIKE '%kw%'：lower() 让索引无法用于定位，前导 % 让 btree 本来也用不上。EXPLAIN 显示走 Filter 全量过滤而非 Index Cond。类层把索引交给服务层，但服务层不知道该怎么用它 —— 声明没有传递下去。",
    "evidence": {
      "like_prefix_lower_ms": 7.959,
      "exact_equal_ms": 0.015,
      "index_cond_present": true,
      "like_has_index_cond": false,
      "scale_rows": 50000
    }
  },
